 "notes": "Control branch: ball-milled (BM) powder d6 -> d8 -> d27 -> d26, closed by contrasts to the freeze-dried (FD) main branch. PACKET ANOMALY: F2's caption is paper Fig. 1 (XRD patterns) but the image file shows paper Fig. 2 (SEM/TEM of BM and FD powders); F1 is a 'Figure captions' page; F3's caption (HRTEM of powders) is paired with Fig. 2 text. Figure ids follow the image files. The XRD evidence is therefore text_only (d10). Figures opened: F2, F4, F5, F6. d16 partial: Y6WO12 identified from a single ~5 nm particle by three d-spacings. d11 is derived from the BSE image (histogram of image-derived sizes). Hardness exists only as text/table (d24). Lost: oxygen-content numbers, the density/oxygen discussion and F7 freeze-segregation schematic (d21 argued)."
